book:Worcestershire Sauce|Worcestershire sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soy sauce]]\n* 2 tbsp [[Cookbook:Honey|honey]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n#Season ribs with rub, and refrigerate for at least 1 hour.\n#Preheat [[Cookbook:Oven|oven]] to 225°F (110°C).\n#Combine liquid ingredients.\n#Place ribs in a large [[Cookbook:Aluminium Foil|foil]] pouch, pour in liquid mixture, and seal pouch.\n#[[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] at 225°F (110°C) for 5–6 hours.\n#Remove ribs from pouches and set aside. Save liquid.\n#Reduce liquid by half over high heat, then lightly [[Cookbook:Brush|brush]] some reduction on top of ribs and place under a preheated broiler. Watch carefully and remove when nicely browned.\n#Rest 15 minutes; serve.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using pork]]\n[[Category:Recipes using wine]]\n[[Category:Braised recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using honey]]\n[[Category:Recipes using liquid smoke]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Firecracker Ribs","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 slab pork spareribs","sourceText":"1 slab pork spareribs","amountText":"1 slab pork spareribs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"¼ cup Firecracker Rub","sourceText":"¼ cup Firecracker Rub","amountText":"¼ cup Firecracker Rub","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"Several drops liquid smoke","sourceText":"Several drops liquid smoke","amountText":"Several drops liquid smoke","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"1 cup white wine","sourceText":"1 cup white wine","amountText":"1 cup white wine","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 tbsp cider vinegar","sourceText":"2 tbsp cider vinegar","amountText":"2 tbsp cider vinegar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"2 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","sourceText":"2 tbsp Worcestershire sauce","amountText":"